    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Bianka Dugas",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105500878574338841463/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLNfaX29ddHyc6pr9hBfsWgrCvleeNjYIu6h92PWm9mFn3mPWc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I had a treatment of laser done here & i’m very happy with my results!! The service I got for my first 5 sessions was alright, the interactions felt unwelcoming. I just went for my last session & I happened to be booked with Léane & she was amazing. she was so nice & caring throughout the whole process. if it’s possible to book laser with a specific staff member, definitely choose her, she’s awesome! She’s the main reason my experience got turned around to give 4 stars!",
        "time": 1729798467,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Chloe S. Legault",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111061486633057893258/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXdplzTy6rOWT3FC7J4gSKNrl5i7fmkXK5JJpepk89DXKnlsv4i=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I recently had the pleasure of visiting Epiderma Vaudreuil, and it was an incredible experience! The moment I walked in, I felt welcomed by the friendly staff and soothing atmosphere. I opted for a facial, and the esthetician tailored the treatment to my skin's needs. My skin has never felt better! The products used were high-quality, and the entire experience was relaxing and rejuvenating. If you’re looking for a place to treat yourself and enhance your skincare routine, I highly recommend Epiderma Vaudreuil, the girls there are great! ♥️",
        "time": 1733024310,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nick Cuccovia",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114114776087983622257/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbjJ8u7muRTzx-FJHEinj8fkST-iOlZX63ImJbBB6Mdzdo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "The staff is very friendly.  Especially Maude who served me for a consultation. I had my treatment with her. Very professional.  I highly recommend.",
        "time": 1737052946,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Angela Campbell",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108917308413117968432/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVHLfDyO0aD4A372jVhS6ixCRRbVmpdelnLOcdrxI-3YQAFFz4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Honestly, felt like a number, part of an assembly line. The Dr. is in only on select days, traveling btwn other offices. What if you can't go on a Monday? Too bad.\nOne good thing about the experience is looking at all of the 'work' she had done to herself was a deterrent for multiple procedures for me. Yikes. No facial expression whatsoever. None. Not a crack. I changed my mind after the esthetician had pitched filler & botox. I ended up having the injection for the 11s, told it would last 3 mo. Barely lasted 6 weeks. 350 down the toilet.\nAu natural for moi.",
        "time": 1725533010,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "baronceavasile Baroncea",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110419894163324352249/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUEGymQcWaYM4frH8WEK6T1VOgLKD1aCKirwKfFi53sLSYv5SJJ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Dr Masson is just amaising,  so happy for my treatment result and the after all experience at the clinic. Such a profetional team!\nThank you for all for your hard work :)",
        "time": 1703214952,
        "translated": false
      }
